WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
One request. From a German call to a cleaner's decision.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A fictional caller starts in Yoshida's browser simulator.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Yoshida gathers the address, appointment and cleaning details in German.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The caller approves the read-back before anything is saved.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
A tentative request is saved. The cleaner still needs to decide.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:46.000
The cleaner reviews the same request in English and confirms it.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
The confirmed booking appears in Upcoming and was checked in the backend.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Local prototype. Fictional data. Illustrative replay.
